# Byte-exact fixtures: checksums attest the producer's exact bytes, so
# checkout line-ending conversion must never touch them (the windows
# runners' CRLF checkout rejected the P21 artifact's seal). The .p21
# inputs are byte-exact too: the replayed trees carry byte offsets, so
# a CRLF-converted input drifts from the baked expected trees.
assets/p21/*.artifact.json -text
assets/p21/fixtures/* -text
